      "level": 2,
      "content": "3.4 Chief Minister and Council of Ministers"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "1flsubq",
      "content": "The Chief Minister is the head of the Council of Ministers in the state. The Chief Minister is appointed by the Governor and must command the confidence of the majority of members in the Vidhan Sabha. The Council of Ministers is collectively responsible to the Vidhan Sabha."
