      "content": "3.7 Panchayati Raj in Madhya Pradesh"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "zseo272",
      "content": "Madhya Pradesh has a three-tier Panchayati Raj system in accordance with the 73rd Constitutional Amendment (1992). The Madhya Pradesh Panchayat Raj Avam Gram Swaraj Adhiniyam, 1993 provides the legal framework for local self-government in rural areas."
    },
